+  // REYNARD DIAGNOSTIC - capture 16 pinned a Gecko-main-thread
+  // EXC_BAD_ACCESS to somewhere between AVPlayerDecoder's
+  // CreateStateMachine probe and Load's return, held invisible by the
+  // attached JIT debugger. These brackets name the statement. They fire
+  // for every decoder, which doubles as the MP4 control experiment: if
